  "title": "Chemistry of C-Trimethylsilyl-Substituted Heterocarboranes. 30. Synthetic and Structural Studies on Oxide Ion Encapsulating Tetralanthanide Tetrahedra Surrounded by “Carbons Apart” C2B4-Carborane Ligands (Ln(III) = La, Nd, Gd, Tb, Ho, Lu)",
  "doi": "10.1021/om0496176",
